oaklogue.onboarding-book.93nm2ec.7=	###
oaklogue.onboarding-book.93nm2ec.8=When left alone, they will play Minecraft alongside you while focusing on their own goals. If you spend time with an §1AI Player§r, they will follow you around and try to help you accomplish your goals.	###
