gm1_sky.admin_tool.home_menu.title=AI Players Management Tool	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.home_menu.invite=§2Invite New AI Players	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.home_menu.moderate=§tManage Current AI Players	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip1=§dTIP§r: Invite an AI Player to your world and find some trees for them to punch!	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip2=§dTIP§r: Interact with an AI Player to open their inventory. You can give them items to help them out or steal from them!	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip3=§dTIP§r: You can have up to 20 AI Players in your world at once!	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip4=§dTIP§r: Use the Admin Panel on a bed to create an AI Home. AI Players will periodically return to their home to store items in chests.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip5=§dTIP§r: Pay attention to an AI Player and they'll play alongside you.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip6=§dTIP§r: If an AI Player is up to trouble, give them a friendly punch to get them to stop what they're doing.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip7=§dTIP§r: You can kick or permanently ban an AI Player from your world if they are misbehaving.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip8=§dTIP§r: You can use the Admin Panel to teleport an AI Player to you if they get lost or stuck.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip9=§dTIP§r: If you need some alone time, set the server offline via the Admin Panel to prevent AI Players from joining your world.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip10=§dTIP§r: AI Players will sometimes log off to do their own thing, but they'll be back later!	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip11=§dTIP§r: Wood, stone, copper, iron, diamond. How far have your AI Players progressed?	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.tooltip12=§dTIP§r: AI Players can fight mobs and hunt animals.	###
