gm1_sky.admin_tool.onboarding_introduction.title=Getting Started	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.onboarding_introduction.body=The AI Players are eager to meet you. You can invite them to your world via this §aAdmin Panel§r.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~AI Players will gather resources and fight monsters. If you SNEAK + INTERACT with an AI Player, they will enter Co-op Mode. They'll follow you around and do as you do.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Using this device, you can better manage them. Kick, ban or teleport them to you.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~If you lose this device, you can craft a new one using a pickaxe, an axe, and a copper ingot.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.onboarding_homes.title=AI Homes	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.onboarding_homes.body=AI Players are capable of more if you give them a home.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Interact with a bed using this §aAdmin Panel§r to create an AI Home. AI Players will recognize it as a place to set up shop.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~While at home, they will store items in chests, craft and smelt. They won't go home if they are in Co-op Mode.	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.onboarding_help.title=Tips & Tricks	###
gm1_sky.admin_tool.onboarding_help.body=AI Players have the following capabilities:~LINEBREAK~- Chopping down trees~LINEBREAK~- Mining ores~LINEBREAK~- Crafting and smelting~LINEBREAK~- Using weapons and armor~LINEBREAK~- Returning to Home Markers to store items in chests~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~In Passive Mode, they will play Minecraft alongside you while focusing on their own goals. In Co-op Mode, they will follow you around and try to help you accomplish your goals. SNEAK + INTERACT them to toggle them between these modes.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~If the AI Player is up to trouble, give them a friendly punch to get them to stop doing what they're doing.	###
